  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9395b1b3-d997-5f58-9821-945e2c169471",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5}{4} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{5}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{2}{5} & -\\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "708a0724-d532-5a52-aec9-056e1be3485f",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "c3b3dba3-eeb3-5721-88c7-1a273573678b",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "88a81c98-403d-560e-9bee-3169d008e747",
